OL,3,GNEWSACyclist seriously injured in crash
OL,4,Awith van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist in his 60s has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured after being involved in a crash
OL,8,Fwith a van in North Hykeham, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police said emergency
OL,12,Fcrews were called to a collision at the
OL,13,Fjunction of Newark Road and St Aidens
OL,14,FRoad shortly before 17:40 BST on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,17,FThe incident involved a blue Ford
OL,18,FTransit van and a man riding a push
OL,19,Fbike, the force said. The rider of the
OL,20,Fpush bike was taken to hospital with
OL,21,Fserious injuries, it added.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
